# Notes

## 2026-05-21
Reviewed the project and normalized its context documentation to match the same convention used for the other playground projects. The folder already had a solid `README.md` plus deeper design/memory docs under `docs/`, so I added `STATE.md` and this `NOTES.md` rather than replacing the existing materials. The codebase is currently a working FastAPI vertical slice: uploads are accepted, files are saved to `artifacts/uploads/`, mocked OCR/parser stages return deterministic note data, and the fingering engine maps those notes to beginner first-position guidance. Tests cover the key baseline routes and mock analysis behavior.

